	(text "Inverting summing amplifier from THT v1.3: Waveblaster (after U13 M62429 volume) x2 = +6 dB through R21/R22 10k,\nPCM5100A x1 through R23/R24 20k, feedback 20k || 47 pF (pole ~170 kHz). U11 runs from ISA +/-12V through 10R / 47uF.\nThe DAC output is ground-centred, so the PCM path is DC coupled (no electrolytic); the M62429 output sits at about\nVCC/2, so C41/C42 (film) couple it. Both channels invert, so left and right keep their relative phase."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fb25f591-5682-50d4-805c-545ff4dda49e")
	)
